  one shape  (P1.2 alone)        24 encodes,    0 wrong  (native 0, ffi 0, hosttc 0, roundtrip 0)
  two shapes (P1.1 + P1.2)       48 encodes,    0 wrong  (native 0, ffi 0, hosttc 0, roundtrip 0)
